	(lib_symbols)
	(text "CONVERTERS\nTO PLACE: two MAX1193 dual 8-bit converters (ADC1 = RX1 + RX2, ADC2 = RX3 + RX4), reference decoupling.\nEach MAX1193 multiplexes its two channels onto one 8-bit bus, so the FPGA sees ADC1_D0..7 and ADC2_D0..7.\nADC_PD: shared power-down control.\nCONFIRMED PART (sourcing thread, 2026-11-19): MAX1193ETI+, TQFN-28 5x5, consigned. Symbol provisional until ADI change notice 2571 is read.\nBus timing and the A/B select output need a datasheet check before drawing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 25.4 0)
